<p>Four lenses on Simplii's competitive position: brand mental availability at each Category Entry Point, where customers move between banks, what distinguishes each competitor's frustration fingerprint, and a Moat Assessment for Simplii.</p>

<h3>3a. Brand mental availability by Category Entry Point</h3>
