<h4 style="margin-top:26px">What separates the two groups most clearly</h4>
<p class="source-note">Origin is zero (no difference). Bars extending left belong to the traditional-relationship segment; bars extending right belong to the digital-first segment. Length is the percentage-point gap between the two groups on that factor.</p>

